WEBVTT

00:00:01.450 --> 00:00:06.090
Every pay period has one week that matters most: the week before payday.

00:00:06.090 --> 00:00:07.573
Here is how it unfolds.

00:00:08.923 --> 00:00:13.981
On Thursday at 8:00 PM Pacific, Workday automatically submits your timecard.

00:00:13.981 --> 00:00:18.373
Before then, enter your expected hours for Friday and the weekend.

00:00:19.723 --> 00:00:25.142
Avoid submitting manually between 8:00 and 9:00 PM Pacific, to prevent system conflicts.

00:00:26.492 --> 00:00:33.169
At 9:00 PM Pacific, timecards with overtime or on-call hours open for your leader to review.

00:00:34.519 --> 00:00:40.874
By Sunday at 2:30 PM Pacific, correct any Friday or weekend estimate that turned out wrong.

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:44.226
Workday re-submits your timecard at that moment.

00:00:45.576 --> 00:00:49.833
Sunday at 6:30 PM Pacific is the final deadline for leaders.

00:00:49.833 --> 00:00:54.728
Anything not approved by then is automatically processed for payment.
